WEBVTT

00:13.080 --> 00:17.180
Even if we gather the crowd,
they'll get scattered after a break.

00:17.180 --> 00:19.540
Do you have any tips, Ms. Mayuri?

00:19.540 --> 00:23.420
The body is the most important thing!
We can’t afford to skip breaks.

00:23.870 --> 00:26.210
- We'll be taking a five-minute break.
- "I want to photograph this girl even if

00:26.210 --> 00:28.770
I have to cut down the time
to photograph other cosplayers."

00:28.770 --> 00:31.760
It's just a matter of whether or not
they can make them feel that way.

00:32.210 --> 00:35.370
I'm sorry.
But we'll start again soon.

00:35.370 --> 00:38.730
That's fine. If it's Lemon and Lime,
I'll wait as long as you want.

00:39.070 --> 00:40.830
Just take your time.

00:42.510 --> 00:45.170
That's the cons of doing joint cosplay.

00:45.170 --> 00:49.030
Liliel's strength is in her
infinite posing variations.

00:49.030 --> 00:51.910
But the other three cannot keep up with her.

00:54.990 --> 00:59.350
Leliel's strengths are not
being utilized at all today.

01:04.250 --> 01:08.630
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

02:31.010 --> 02:36.010
#20 A WORLD MADE WITH FRIENDS

02:43.710 --> 02:46.270
Was it a mistake to do a joint cosplay?

02:46.750 --> 02:47.960
No...

02:47.960 --> 02:51.340
We couldn't have attracted this many
people if we didn't have all four of us.

02:51.740 --> 02:54.400
We have to think about
what we can do in this situation.

02:55.540 --> 02:56.800
Lilysa.

02:57.890 --> 03:00.380
Just tell me what poses
you want to do and I'll follow.

03:00.380 --> 03:02.540
We'll never get more people otherwise!

03:02.960 --> 03:06.960
But then Mikari and Aria
would be left behind...

03:06.960 --> 03:11.300
It's true that I don't know which scene
I should do the pose or what to do...

03:12.140 --> 03:15.190
If it was just Lilysa and Nonopi,
they would be perfect.

03:15.190 --> 03:16.770
But because of me...

03:16.770 --> 03:19.300
To think I'm the one holding us back...

03:19.760 --> 03:23.410
D-Don't worry!
I'll do my best!

03:23.410 --> 03:25.310
The responsibility is all on me!

03:25.610 --> 03:28.540
But then, what should I do?

03:30.670 --> 03:33.730
It's good that you got fired up,
but how are you gonna do that?

03:33.730 --> 03:37.950
Huh? Wait, Lilysa, you didn't
drink any water, did you?

03:38.950 --> 03:41.280
Eh? Ah, umm...

03:41.280 --> 03:42.250
A PERFECTIONIST COSPLAYER

03:42.250 --> 03:45.260
A PERFECTIONIST COSPLAYER
Liliel doesn't drink from plastic bottles...

03:45.260 --> 03:46.330
A PERFECTIONIST COSPLAYER
What?!

03:46.330 --> 03:49.010
A PERFECTIONIST COSPLAYER
If my makeup falls off, it'll ruin my character,

03:49.010 --> 03:51.000
A PERFECTIONIST COSPLAYER
so I use powder to stop the sweat.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.610
You can't do that!

03:52.610 --> 03:56.580
But I've kept this setup
perfectly until today!

03:56.580 --> 04:00.470
I've had enough of your perfectionism!
Drink water!

04:01.550 --> 04:04.580
I know I went too far.

04:04.580 --> 04:08.190
But for me, it wouldn't be cosplay
if I didn't do things this way.

04:08.190 --> 04:09.180
But...

04:09.180 --> 04:10.180
Girls!

04:11.340 --> 04:14.080
I'm in love with her way of doing things,

04:14.080 --> 04:16.470
so let her do whatever cosplay
she wants to do.

04:16.470 --> 04:17.860
Aria...

04:18.250 --> 04:19.260
That's why...

04:20.990 --> 04:22.310
I won't drink water either.

04:22.310 --> 04:23.030
What?

04:23.710 --> 04:25.950
I decided to do things in your way.

04:25.950 --> 04:28.120
Y-You can't do that!

04:28.580 --> 04:32.080
My perfection is nothing more
than just self-satisfaction.

04:32.080 --> 04:36.790
I can't impose my way of doing things
on other people, much less my friends.

04:37.750 --> 04:39.930
Isn't that lonely?

04:40.240 --> 04:40.910
Huh?

04:41.450 --> 04:42.330
Guys!

04:43.350 --> 04:45.450
Senior, Lilysa is...

04:45.450 --> 04:47.510
I heard everything.

04:47.510 --> 04:51.350
I've been anticipating Lilysa's
perfectionism and prepared this.

04:51.350 --> 04:52.130
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY

04:52.130 --> 04:53.830
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY
It's the Mithril lunchbox set

04:53.830 --> 04:55.820
LUNCHBOX SET MADE FROM PURE MITHRIL
Liliel used in the original works!

04:55.820 --> 04:57.090
LUNCHBOX SET MADE FROM PURE MITHRIL
Complete with thermos!

04:57.090 --> 04:57.820
LUNCHBOX SET MADE FROM PURE MITHRIL
What?!

04:58.210 --> 04:59.750
You'll drink from this, right?

04:59.750 --> 05:03.590
But, Senior...
It's mint in sealed box!

05:03.590 --> 05:05.660
And this one is...

05:05.660 --> 05:06.960
ORIGINAL DESIGN
Yeah.

05:06.960 --> 05:08.380
100% ALUMINIUM
It's a very rare item

05:08.380 --> 05:09.620
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY PURE MITHRIL LUNCHBOX SET
that only produced five boxes.

05:09.620 --> 05:10.900
What?!

05:10.900 --> 05:12.410
Only five?!

05:12.410 --> 05:13.680
That's a treasure!

05:13.680 --> 05:15.460
I-Is that okay?

05:16.050 --> 05:20.170
If Liliel is going to use it,
I'd be happy to give it as an otaku.

05:20.170 --> 05:21.920
Senior...

05:21.920 --> 05:26.140
Okumura... You seemed
so cool for a bit there.

05:26.580 --> 05:28.350
Hey, that Liliel...

05:28.350 --> 05:30.990
...is drinking water from
the original Leliel water bottle.

05:30.990 --> 05:34.330
Amazing. She's really obsessed,
as they say she is.

05:34.330 --> 05:36.320
She's the real Liliel.

05:38.080 --> 05:39.150
Listen up, everyone.

05:39.650 --> 05:41.360
I have an idea.

05:41.360 --> 05:44.020
That's a death flag, Senior.

05:45.600 --> 05:47.830
We'll resume the shooting!

05:51.500 --> 05:53.830
They're looking straight at the camera!

05:54.190 --> 05:55.290
If you can't pose,

05:55.290 --> 05:57.150
- at least align your eye contact.
- Please look here!

05:57.150 --> 05:57.990
Me too!

05:57.990 --> 05:59.630
I'll be the landmark.

06:00.250 --> 06:01.390
Look at me!

06:01.390 --> 06:02.680
Please look here!

06:02.680 --> 06:03.110
Please!

06:03.110 --> 06:04.460
They're making eye contact!

06:04.460 --> 06:06.630
- I'll get a good picture!
- Please look here!

06:08.600 --> 06:11.220
It looks like their crowd is growing.

06:11.220 --> 06:13.560
Not bad. We can't lose to them!

06:14.630 --> 06:18.500
But it's getting super hot, isn't it?

06:18.500 --> 06:21.240
This is not good.
Let's take some more time for our break.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.320
Okumura!

06:23.280 --> 06:27.500
I know things are just getting better,
but don't get greedy and neglect your break.

06:27.500 --> 06:29.160
Y-Yes, ma'am.

06:29.160 --> 06:31.740
Liliel, time for a break!

06:37.380 --> 06:39.160
If we don't have many poses,

06:39.160 --> 06:43.030
we'll deliver the perfect pose
from above to below!

06:43.880 --> 06:45.180
Gosh...

06:45.180 --> 06:48.600
That Liliel is really amazing.

06:48.600 --> 06:51.030
Her energy's on a different
level than the rest.

06:52.650 --> 06:55.070
Are we allowed to upload their photos?

06:55.070 --> 06:57.190
Yeah, they gave the okay at the start.

06:57.190 --> 06:59.260
I think we can still get better shots.

07:01.980 --> 07:04.820
This is it. I have to do my best.

07:08.820 --> 07:10.820
At least I have to.

07:10.820 --> 07:13.650
I'm the only one who can
give a perfect cosplay...

07:14.780 --> 07:15.920
Huh...?

07:21.340 --> 07:23.310
Nonopi, are you okay?

07:23.310 --> 07:25.070
Y-Yeah...

07:25.070 --> 07:26.550
Lilysa, let's take a break...

07:29.640 --> 07:31.600
Lilysa, are you okay?

07:33.250 --> 07:35.710
I... I'm sorry...

07:35.710 --> 07:37.310
I just suddenly...

07:37.310 --> 07:38.750
Liliel?!

07:39.190 --> 07:40.270
Did something happen?!

07:40.870 --> 07:43.630
She collapsed?!
Did she hit her head?!

07:43.630 --> 07:45.530
I-I caught her.

07:45.530 --> 07:46.780
Ms. Mayuri...

07:47.170 --> 07:51.210
It's probably heatstroke.
Let's get you somewhere cool first.

07:51.210 --> 07:53.700
Then we'll have you checked out
at the emergency room.

07:54.980 --> 07:56.040
Can you walk?

07:56.510 --> 07:58.430
We're gonna get you inside, okay?

08:01.880 --> 08:03.350
That's rough.

08:03.350 --> 08:04.510
Is there any staff around?

08:05.210 --> 08:06.990
Ms. Mayuri, I'll do it.

08:06.990 --> 08:07.550
Huh?

08:07.900 --> 08:10.090
Just help me get her up.

08:10.090 --> 08:14.560
Heave... ho!

08:23.520 --> 08:27.230
D-Don't push yourself too hard,
or you'll collapse too.

08:27.780 --> 08:29.200
Nonoa...

08:31.020 --> 08:33.530
I will protect you even if
it costs me my life.

08:34.640 --> 08:36.250
Nokiel...

08:38.190 --> 08:39.940
She's strong.

08:43.150 --> 08:44.660
The real Nokiel...

08:45.940 --> 08:46.670
Hey!

08:49.130 --> 08:51.410
It's a mild heatstroke.

08:52.390 --> 08:57.260
But you'll be just fine if you're still
conscious and drink more water.

08:57.260 --> 08:59.600
Please don't push yourself
and take a rest today.

09:00.530 --> 09:00.940
But...

09:00.940 --> 09:02.310
Are you listening to her?!

09:02.310 --> 09:03.690
She's right, Lilysa!

09:03.690 --> 09:05.290
But...

09:05.290 --> 09:06.650
If it were Ariel,

09:07.440 --> 09:10.110
she would tell her friends
not to push themselves.

09:15.060 --> 09:16.180
Okay...

09:18.730 --> 09:21.730
Mita, did you find Liliel yet?

09:21.730 --> 09:24.250
I've only seen pictures of Mikarin so far.

09:24.840 --> 09:27.880
For some reason, I hadn't gotten any news
from her since mid-afternoon.

09:29.280 --> 09:30.720
It's fine.

09:31.090 --> 09:32.720
COSPLAY SUMMARY

09:32.720 --> 09:36.010
"The twin cosplayers draw a crowd
on par with heavenly queens."

09:36.450 --> 09:39.450
"Lemon & Lime attract
a staggering first-day crowd."

09:39.450 --> 09:43.260
"Nagomi's photoshoot breaks attendance
records at the corporate booths."

09:43.260 --> 09:45.290
"Still no sight of Miss Mayura."

09:45.290 --> 09:48.310
"Will Lemon & Lime be going to take
the next Heavenly Queens throne?"

09:48.770 --> 09:54.020
"Breaking news: Cases of heatstroke skyrocketed
in unprecedented heat on Day 1."

10:00.710 --> 10:02.710
This is depressing.

10:03.370 --> 10:05.470
Hey, what's the plan for tomorrow?

10:05.470 --> 10:07.540
If you're all better, you're going, right?

10:07.540 --> 10:09.920
Y-Yes, of course.

10:11.690 --> 10:13.630
I am sorry about today.

10:14.070 --> 10:16.730
It was all my fault.

10:16.730 --> 10:18.890
But it's not your fault...

10:18.890 --> 10:21.980
Anyone could have collapsed in that heat.

10:22.370 --> 10:24.670
No, it was my carelessness!

10:24.670 --> 10:26.440
I'll take full responsibility!

10:26.870 --> 10:29.030
I'll take care of it tomorrow!

10:29.030 --> 10:31.610
I'll figure something out.

10:31.610 --> 10:34.020
You all just get some rest!

10:36.540 --> 10:39.290
But it's you who really needs rest!

10:39.290 --> 10:40.860
But...

10:40.860 --> 10:42.990
C-Calm down, Mikarin.

10:52.490 --> 10:54.800
N-Nonoa?

10:55.130 --> 10:56.830
Stop it already.

10:56.830 --> 10:59.760
"I'll do it,"
"I'll do my best,"...

11:00.140 --> 11:04.250
"I can't impose on everyone,
and everyone should get some rest."

11:04.610 --> 11:07.060
Don't decide everything by yourself!

11:08.270 --> 11:11.900
You said that we're friends, didn't you?

11:12.380 --> 11:14.650
Involve me in this, too!

11:15.540 --> 11:18.960
We know it... You're doing this
because you're a kind person.

11:18.960 --> 11:20.870
But you're doing this to anyone!

11:20.870 --> 11:23.180
Then what's the point of us being friends?!

11:23.180 --> 11:25.710
I'm not a stranger, so what can I do?!

11:25.710 --> 11:28.040
Don't keep everything to yourself!

11:28.040 --> 11:32.430
Tell us what you're thinking
and what you want to do with us.

11:32.430 --> 11:35.450
I don't know if I can do it or not,

11:35.450 --> 11:38.020
or you may think
that I am just a bother.

11:38.690 --> 11:42.220
But you should still say,
"Let's do it together!"

11:43.490 --> 11:47.460
If you don't like it, then say it.
If you can't do it, then say it.

11:47.460 --> 11:49.750
You don't need to worry about us!

11:50.710 --> 11:55.650
I'm going to say how I really feel right now!

11:58.020 --> 12:01.820
The train will arrive at platform 2.

12:04.070 --> 12:08.080
I know how it feels.
And I'm sure you know it too.

12:08.080 --> 12:12.100
It's easy to be alone.
It's easy not to make friends.

12:12.500 --> 12:15.630
I don't have to worry about anyone.

12:16.770 --> 12:19.930
It's easy. But also, incredibly hard.

12:20.640 --> 12:23.090
I was all alone today.

12:25.310 --> 12:29.270
Aren't we friends?! Aren't we besties?!
I want to give my body and my soul

12:29.270 --> 12:32.110
to this fight as much as you give yours!

12:32.630 --> 12:34.570
Nonoa...

12:34.570 --> 12:37.530
I wouldn't go that far.

12:38.320 --> 12:40.490
But I agree with her complaint about you.

12:41.010 --> 12:47.080
But for a moment, it made me want
that kind of intense friendship.

12:47.730 --> 12:50.790
Mikari, Aria...

12:51.390 --> 12:53.310
Let's do this together, Lilysa.

12:53.310 --> 12:58.180
I've got things to do,
so if you're in, just say it.

12:58.180 --> 13:00.760
I don't do things halfheartedly.

13:12.410 --> 13:14.060
Okay, right on to the next pose!

13:15.090 --> 13:16.820
Are they practicing dance?

13:16.820 --> 13:18.530
Oh, to be young again.

13:19.010 --> 13:22.290
This is Master Ash's pose.
Nokiel, that's perfect.

13:22.290 --> 13:24.490
Ariel, kneel a bit more to the left.

13:24.810 --> 13:27.350
Miriella, angle your right arm up 30 degrees.

13:27.760 --> 13:30.210
It's getting cooler,
but don't push yourselves too hard.

13:36.010 --> 13:38.900
That covers about 50 poses.

13:38.900 --> 13:40.880
Please remember it all by tomorrow.

13:40.880 --> 13:42.590
Are you crazy?!

13:44.070 --> 13:46.410
But... I'll give it a shot.

13:46.410 --> 13:47.420
I'll do it!

13:47.420 --> 13:50.520
If you can remember all that,
then so can I.

13:52.030 --> 13:53.970
The reason Lilysa remembers these poses

13:53.970 --> 13:55.190
is because she loves the manga.

13:55.190 --> 13:56.090
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY
is because she loves the manga.

13:56.090 --> 13:57.650
LILIEL'S SIDE STORY
You can remember them from the stories too.

13:57.650 --> 14:01.360
A main pose and a special move
for the enemy from volume 1.

14:01.360 --> 14:03.650
A new special move from volume 2.

14:03.650 --> 14:06.620
It is a stronger technique,
so the gesture is more flashier.

14:06.950 --> 14:10.780
This is the scene where Lilysa spilled
her juice in the excitement at the screening.

14:12.260 --> 14:15.550
It's easy to remember if you have
the trigger in your memory, isn't it?

14:15.550 --> 14:18.610
You may forget English words,
but you will never forget a great scene.

14:18.610 --> 14:19.800
That's what makes us otaku.

14:20.450 --> 14:24.510
If you pose in chronological order,
you'll not get confused.

14:24.900 --> 14:27.870
Then we won't have to discuss
with each other every time.

14:27.870 --> 14:30.870
I'll compile a list while you guys practice.

14:30.870 --> 14:33.130
Yes, please do!

14:34.910 --> 14:37.430
That's right! You nailed it!

14:37.430 --> 14:38.730
It's perfect!

14:39.210 --> 14:41.690
Now let's start from the top again.

14:43.650 --> 14:46.380
Is that yours, Nonopi?
Your smartphone is ringing.

14:46.380 --> 14:48.660
Huh? Is it from mom?

14:49.530 --> 14:52.030
New follower notifications!

14:52.030 --> 14:53.620
I-It won't stop!

14:54.810 --> 14:57.080
D-Did I do something wrong?!

14:58.790 --> 14:59.310
FOR COMPARISON

14:59.310 --> 15:00.730
FOR COMPARISON
For real?

15:00.730 --> 15:01.490
NOKIEL CARRIES THE FALLEN LILIEL TO THE FIRST
AID ROOM AS IF SHE WERE A PRINCESS

15:01.490 --> 15:02.260
A TOUCHING SCENE, JUST LIKE IT'S ORIGINAL

15:02.260 --> 15:02.510
COMMENT:

15:02.510 --> 15:02.920
I KNOW IT'S INAPPROPRIATE,
BUT IT WAS REALLY MOVING

15:02.920 --> 15:03.470
I DON'T MEAN TO PRY, BUT ISN'T THIS VOYEURISM?
IT'S A NEW REPORT

15:03.470 --> 15:05.130
That moment generated a crazy buzz!

15:05.130 --> 15:06.680
And it's on my account...

15:06.680 --> 15:07.120
IS LILIEL OKAY?!
And it's on my account...

15:07.120 --> 15:07.730
I WISH I WERE THERE!!
And it's on my account...

15:07.730 --> 15:08.330
ARE YOU GOING TOMORROW AS WELL?
And it's on my account...

15:08.330 --> 15:09.140
IF THERE'S AN OPPORTUNITY,
I'D LOVE TO SHOOT YOU!

15:11.600 --> 15:13.810
WE'RE SORRY TO MAKE EVERYONE WORRY
LILIEL HAD MILD HEATSTROKE,

15:13.810 --> 15:14.560
BUT SHE'S ALL BETTER NOW

15:14.690 --> 15:15.470
THANK GOODNESS!

15:15.470 --> 15:18.020
NO WONDER, IT'S BEEN A HELL OF A DAY
PEOPLE WERE COLLAPSING LEFT AND RIGHT

15:18.150 --> 15:20.480
IF LILIEL IS FEELING BETTER,
WE'LL BE GOING AGAIN TOMORROW

15:23.130 --> 15:25.900
Wow... Everyone wants to
shoot our joint cosplay.

15:26.930 --> 15:28.660
This is a great chance to take revenge.

15:29.280 --> 15:30.490
It's all thanks to Nonoa.

15:31.530 --> 15:32.330
Yes!

15:34.670 --> 15:37.920
Tomorrow is the day...
I will do my best cosplay!

15:37.920 --> 15:40.590
Will all my friends here!

15:41.090 --> 15:42.300
Alright, gather around!

15:42.300 --> 15:43.050
What?

15:43.050 --> 15:45.500
I'm still not used to this...

15:45.500 --> 15:48.750
Liliel...

15:48.750 --> 15:50.160
...explosion!

16:03.200 --> 16:05.840
I hear today is going to be relatively cool.

16:05.840 --> 16:09.280
Senior, I forgot my hat again.

16:09.280 --> 16:12.280
Oh, I've brought a spare hat today.

16:12.660 --> 16:14.020
Meow~

16:14.620 --> 16:15.860
Thanks...

16:15.860 --> 16:16.870
It looks good on you.

16:17.210 --> 16:19.060
Alright, let's get changed!

16:19.060 --> 16:19.580
Yes!

16:20.640 --> 16:22.790
Umm... Everyone.

16:23.200 --> 16:28.510
Is it okay for me to impose
my selfishness on you guys?

16:30.000 --> 16:30.970
Eh?

16:31.440 --> 16:34.260
Geez, how long are you gonna hold back?

16:34.770 --> 16:36.640
Don't make us repeat it!

16:37.040 --> 16:39.980
Just say it!
Say what you want to do with us!

16:41.420 --> 16:43.940
Then...
Umm...

16:44.380 --> 16:47.930
I want to cosplay with all your might today!

16:47.930 --> 16:49.910
Please do your best to keep up!

16:54.030 --> 16:56.790
Lemon & Lime are cosplaying
Luck and Luka today!

16:58.190 --> 17:00.670
Let's show them who's number one today.

17:00.670 --> 17:04.420
Lemon, you're surprisingly
concerned about that ranking.

17:04.420 --> 17:07.780
Because it would piss me off
if they ranked us as they please.

17:07.780 --> 17:10.570
We'll be the number one
at this Summer Comiket...

17:14.490 --> 17:15.260
Hey...

17:15.260 --> 17:16.180
Yeah.

17:16.550 --> 17:18.890
A-Are we really going to be okay?

17:18.890 --> 17:23.580
They were looking at me like,
"She's the girl who passed out yesterday."

17:23.580 --> 17:25.040
You're just overthinking it!

17:25.040 --> 17:27.280
They said they were
looking forward to seeing you.

17:27.740 --> 17:33.360
Idiot. There're always gonna be people
with twisted thoughts like that.

17:33.360 --> 17:36.200
You'll only notice if you feel like
you've done something wrong.

17:36.560 --> 17:38.350
If you forget about them, it's all over.

17:38.350 --> 17:41.210
As expected from Mikarin.
You really have the experience.

17:41.600 --> 17:44.190
Let's just forget about them
and have fun today.

17:44.190 --> 17:46.130
Summer Comiket only comes once a year.

17:46.130 --> 17:49.470
That's right.
I'm looking forward to today.

17:49.470 --> 17:52.050
We're doing this 'the Lilysa way' after all.

18:10.990 --> 18:13.200
Liliel!

18:13.200 --> 18:14.690
We've been waiting for you!

18:14.690 --> 18:16.240
Glad to see you're doing well!

18:16.240 --> 18:18.910
You're so cool, Nonoa!

18:19.610 --> 18:21.100
Mikarin!

18:21.100 --> 18:22.830
Ariel is stunning too!

18:32.100 --> 18:33.310
Let's do this.

18:38.530 --> 18:40.530
From the signature pose of the volume 1.

18:48.650 --> 18:51.490
Once you've aligned your gazes,
move into the next pose.

18:51.490 --> 18:53.340
The special moves from the volume 1.

18:54.060 --> 18:56.160
They're perfectly in sync!

18:56.540 --> 18:58.190
The victory pose.

18:59.440 --> 19:02.080
This is nothing like yesterday!

19:02.790 --> 19:04.290
Now, from the volume 2.

19:04.290 --> 19:06.170
There are still more poses?!

19:06.170 --> 19:08.950
The front row doesn't show
any intention of leaving!

19:08.950 --> 19:10.250
It's getting cramped back here!

19:10.620 --> 19:13.590
What's with this huge crowd
first thing in the morning?!

19:18.990 --> 19:20.510
We can't lose to them...

19:20.510 --> 19:24.520
They won't be able to see my sign.

19:24.520 --> 19:27.020
How's their eye contact?

19:33.620 --> 19:36.450
Trivial problems like this
are no longer bothering them.

19:37.580 --> 19:39.910
I didn't need to worry about a thing

19:40.660 --> 19:43.340
when they were sincerely enjoying cosplay.

19:45.590 --> 19:46.830
Ah...

19:46.830 --> 19:47.440
HEAVENLY SHEEP VILLAGE

19:47.440 --> 19:49.290
ARE YOU AN ANGEL FROM AIRBORNE SQUAD?
This world...

19:49.680 --> 19:52.830
Only I can see this world.
I don't know if this is a dream or not.

19:54.350 --> 19:57.220
You're in high school and still play house?

19:58.250 --> 19:59.910
When I'm alone,

19:59.910 --> 20:03.790
I suddenly come back here
and feel so empty.

20:04.690 --> 20:05.520
But now...

20:06.020 --> 20:07.270
Things are different.

20:10.790 --> 20:12.490
Are you okay, Miss Liliel?

20:12.490 --> 20:14.270
Are you tired already, Liliel?

20:14.270 --> 20:16.700
If you're tired, just leave it to me.

20:17.690 --> 20:19.970
I've got friends by my side.

20:21.970 --> 20:23.990
And I'll be relying on them all today.

20:23.990 --> 20:26.870
Nokiel, Miriella, Ariel.

20:30.270 --> 20:32.230
We're being serious here!

20:33.810 --> 20:36.500
I've found others like me in this world.

20:36.910 --> 20:38.510
Both in this world and in reality.

20:38.860 --> 20:40.510
There's no need to worry.

20:40.910 --> 20:43.970
I'm cosplaying with my friends.

20:44.320 --> 20:48.700
Not for anything else.
I just overflowed with love.

20:49.990 --> 20:51.270
I've given all my might...

20:51.270 --> 20:54.400
...to create the world of the manga
that I've deeply fallen in love with.

20:56.970 --> 20:58.390
I couldn't be happier.

21:04.090 --> 21:06.150
Seems like we can't win today.

21:06.150 --> 21:08.250
Hey, don't give up yet, Lime!

21:08.860 --> 21:10.870
We'll be taking a five-minutes break!

21:13.860 --> 21:14.590
Lilysa.

21:16.650 --> 21:18.210
I think I get it now.

21:18.650 --> 21:20.130
Your way of doing things...

21:21.160 --> 21:25.170
For a minute there,
I felt like I was in my dad's manga.

21:25.870 --> 21:28.560
Thank you, Lilysa.

21:28.560 --> 21:30.340
No...

21:30.340 --> 21:34.150
I should be thanking you.
You taught me...

21:34.150 --> 21:35.840
...what it means to be a friend.

21:40.150 --> 21:44.480
Friendship isn't just about
doing your best for your friends.

21:45.360 --> 21:51.750
I've never known anyone to be so happy
to be doing their best for someone else.

21:52.850 --> 21:56.370
It might seem like a lie,
but my heart feels so light today.

21:56.370 --> 22:00.220
I was able to enjoy cosplaying together
from the bottom of my heart.

22:00.940 --> 22:02.960
I'm really glad...

22:03.420 --> 22:04.750
...that I came to Comiket...

22:05.750 --> 22:07.180
...with you guys.

22:11.140 --> 22:13.300
Too soon for you to cry, Liliel!

22:13.300 --> 22:15.690
That's right.
We're only getting started here.

22:15.690 --> 22:17.940
Let's have some more fun today!

22:17.940 --> 22:19.710
Y-Yes!

23:55.080 --> 24:01.170
THE STORY OF THE PROTAGONIST
